{"quest":{"line_id":"11010516","line_type":"5","order":195,"title":{"cn":"老板娘的特别任务","en":"Special Mission","jp":"女将さんの特別任務","kr":"여사장님의 특별 임무"},"description":{"cn":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""},"reputation_camp_id":"101","reputation_camp_title":{"cn":"赏金猎人","en":"Bounty Hunters","jp":"バウンティハンター","kr":"현상금 사냥꾼"},"route":"#/season-1/daily/11010516","assets":[{"asset_key":"optional/objective_11010516:1:1"},{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11225310"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_11010516:1:2"},{"asset_key":"faction_dailies/menu_11010516:1:2"},{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11225330"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_11010516:1:3"},{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11225340"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_11010516:1:4"},{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11225350"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_11010516:1:5"},{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11225360"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_11010516:1:6"},{"asset_key":"faction_dailies/menu_11010516:1:6"},{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11225370"}],"tasks":[{"task_id":"1","steps":[{"step_id":"1","pre_step_ids":[],"objective_title":{"cn":"与银喙对话","en":"Talk to Silverbeak","jp":"シルバービークと話す","kr":"실버 빅과 대화하기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"基地里来了一些新委托，向银喙询问一下有没有能帮上忙的吧。","en":"The base has accepted some new commissions. Ask Silverbeak whether he needs help.","jp":"基地に新たな依頼が来たようだ。何か手伝えることがないかシルバービークに聞いてみよう。","kr":"기지에 새로운 의뢰가 도착했다. 실버 빅에게 도움이 필요한지 물어보도록 하자."}},{"step_id":"2","pre_step_ids":["1"],"objective_title":{"cn":"寻找欠账的撒尼尔","en":"Find Thaniel","jp":"サニエルを探す","kr":"빚쟁이 다니엘 찾기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"前往咸水镇西边的山坳，寻找欠账不还的撒尼尔，讨回欠款。","en":"Go to the hollow west of Alkali to find Thaniel, who is a deadbeat, and collect the debt.","jp":"鹹水町の西側にある山あいのくぼ地に向かってサニエルを探し、彼から借金を取り戻そう。","kr":"세일린워터 마을 서쪽의 평원에서 빚을 갚지 않은 다니엘을 찾아 빚을 갚게 하자."}},{"step_id":"3","pre_step_ids":["2"],"objective_title":{"cn":"游玩百物牌","en":"Play Cards","jp":"百物集で遊ぶ","kr":"만물 카드 게임하기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"用百物牌战胜撒尼尔，让他心甘情愿地交出欠款。","en":"Beat Thaniel in Century Quest to make him pay willingly.","jp":"百物集の勝負でサニエルに勝利し、自発的に借金を返すよう促そう。","kr":"만물 카드로 다니엘을 이기고 기꺼이 빚을 갚게끔 하자."}},{"step_id":"4","pre_step_ids":["3"],"objective_title":{"cn":"教训撒尼尔","en":"Punish Thaniel","jp":"サニエルを懲らしめる","kr":"다니엘 혼내주기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"没想到撒尼尔居然这么无耻，输了百物牌也不肯还钱。看来必须得给他一点颜色瞧瞧了。","en":"Thaniel is shameless enough to refuse payment even after losing to you in Century Quest. You need to teach him a lesson.","jp":"サニエルがここまで恥知らずだったとは、百物集の勝負に負けても金を返そうとしない。彼を懲らしめてやろう。","kr":"뻔뻔한 다니엘은 만물 카드에 져놓고도 돈을 갚지 않으려고 한다. 그에게 본때를 보여줘야 할 것 같다."}},{"step_id":"5","pre_step_ids":["4"],"objective_title":{"cn":"找出背包里的钱袋","en":"Find the Pouch","jp":"巾着を探し出す","kr":"가방 안의 지갑 찾아내기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"撒尼尔总算交出了他的背包，从里面找出他的钱袋吧。","en":"Finally, Thaniel hands you his backpack. Find his pouch.","jp":"サニエルがようやくカバンを差し出した。中から彼の巾着を探し出そう。","kr":"다니엘이 드디어 그의 가방을 건네주었다. 가방 안에서 그의 지갑을 찾아내자."}},{"step_id":"6","pre_step_ids":["5"],"objective_title":{"cn":"与旅店老板娘对话","en":"Talk to Innkeeper","jp":"宿屋の女将さんと話す","kr":"주점 여사장과 대화하기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"前往旅店，将撒尼尔的欠款还给老板娘。","en":"Go to the inn and pass Thaniel's money over to the owner.","jp":"宿屋へ向かい、サニエルの借金を女将さんに返そう。","kr":"주점으로 가 다니엘이 빌린 돈을 여사장에게 돌려주도록 하자."}}]}],"archive_scope":"Configured faction daily paths. Live assignment, NPC visibility and minigame/battle success are not simulated.","source_plot_joins":[{"plot":"11225310","asset":"ep1/quest_story_11225310","resource":"nodecanvas/dialoguetree/ep1/quest_story_11225310.asset","raw_sha256":"36fce233ab29f3ea00372b5a29e2d555ee51ef68ff4d1de43f74a2155b9efd2b","lpak":"binary_NodeCanvas_DialogueTree_17859706585472604641.lpak","offset":6084872,"size":1744,"identity":"11010516:1:1","field":"verified_npc_task_menu"},{"plot":"11225330","asset":"ep1/quest_story_11225330","resource":"nodecanvas/dialoguetree/ep1/quest_story_11225330.asset","raw_sha256":"627a9c5d63942769579bfaa4fa4f5dc3727f038f0272467bbb176ed14ad78f4c","lpak":"binary_NodeCanvas_DialogueTree_17859706585472604641.